    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5e8b2d9d-961d-5a5c-b0d8-e3ad3b4ef1cb" activityNameId="7fd797fd-dde0-5794-a3a2-b27a69445838" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Manganese oxide (Mn2O3), at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Manganese oxide (Mn2O3), at plant
The dataset can be used for example as base material in the production of spinell type lithium manganese oxide Data are based on patents. ;
CAS number: 001317-34-6; 
Formula: Mn2O3; 
Synonyms: Manganese sesquioxide; 
UUID: 70ce107a-39a5-3b2e-a321-d2522517c70b
This dataset includes rosting of manganese carbonate in a rotary kiln in a specified nitrogen/oxygen-atmosphere.  Energy consumption, carbon monoxide and carbon dioxide emissions to air are calculated. For infrastructure, the ecoinvent dataset "chemical plant, organics" is accounted. Transportation efforts are based on ecoinvent standard estimates.
Location: Some Swiss or European datasets are used for global processes.
Technology: This dataset includes rosting of manganese carbonate in a rotary kiln at temperatures around 500°C. Assumption: CO to the atmosphere is equal to the CO after thermal post-combustion (&lt;20mgC/Nm3). No infrastructure for thermal post combustion an no heat through the burning process of CO is calculated.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: patent, ecoinvent 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is assessed using the pedigree matrix.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_70ce107a-39a5-3b2e-a321-d2522517c70b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3142d8e2-0d30-557e-b090-9faae2b72357" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
